# One move of the Connect Four game (phase2/P2-02 §2.3). /brain/drop: the token held at HANDOVER goes into a
# column. /brain/pick: a token is taken at a station of the dispenser and brought to HANDOVER (ADR-041).
# The token's centre in base_link, m: at the release (so101_connect4.board.column_target), or where it waits at
# its station (board.station_target)
geometry_msgs/Point target
# true: nothing moves, and the arm may be anywhere. The reply comes at once: whether the move would start,
# where the camera sees the grid and the dispenser now (P2-02 §2.5); busy while the brain moves the arm
bool check_only
---
bool success    # replied at the end of the move, the arm back at HANDOVER; with check_only, at once
# "done in <s> s" ("" with check_only); or no_token, unreachable, not_at_handover, not_idle:<state>, busy,
# no_joint_states, stopped, timeout:<step>, no_grid_pose, no_dispenser_pose, not_edge_on, unsafe_path:<step>
string message
